{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713480/extras/626d3734ff70f24df44f982f1d3a8bef.avif?t=1768570743\" width=1560 height=3328 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every human carries a reincarnation: a spiritual essence \u2014 animal, monstrous, or divine. <br>Long ago, all lived in balance. But that harmony shattered when some discovered they could <strong>consume the souls of others</strong> to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two factions now stand in eternal opposition:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rivandy \u2014 Guardians of Balance</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sacred circle devoted to protecting wandering souls and preserving the natural order. They rise against corruption, shielding the world from chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dechys \u2014 Devourers of Souls</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted beings who feast upon spirits to transform into apocalyptic entities. Their hunger is endless, their ambition boundless.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Polemos \u2014 The Battlefield of Souls</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polemos is a mystical island where dawn reignites the war every single day. Here, the light itself cannot erase the scars of conflict. Countless lost souls drift in this place, trapped in an endless struggle between guardians and predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Rivandy</strong>, protectors of order and innocent spirits. <br>Or <strong>embrace the corruption of the D\u00e9chys</strong>, conquering and devouring souls to fuel your evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? <br><strong>Become the most powerful spirit</strong>, survive, evolve, and impose your vision of destiny across the battlefields of Polemos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi